                  <list listType="unordered">
                     <item>dissolve contents of one packet into 8 oz. hot water; sip while hot. Consume entire drink within 10-15 minutes.</item>
                     <item>if using a microwave, add contents of one packet to 8 oz. of cool water; stir briskly before and after heating. Do not overheat.</item>
